ple currencies and  total decentralization of the protocol  which is huge here's some of the major  changes  in v 3.0 the migration of the protocol  from ethereum to the binance smart chain  establishing a bi-directional bridge  between both networks so users can  transfer pma tokens from ethereum  to the binance smart smart chain and  back  support for more tokens and a mechanism  to swap  tokens automatically upon payment this  will let users pay  with whatever token they want merchants  can settle with the token  they want and that includes stable coins  and this will help merchants avoid the  crypto volatility risk we've talked  about for so long  introducing liquidity pools and  automatic swaps  full decentralization of the back end  and the introduction of  executors and full compatibility with  metamask  and other wallets to facilitate payment  and settlement in any currency  pumapay is now introducing liquidity  pools to the ecosystem and the goal of  doing this  is encourage people to deposit liquidity  to puma pays pools because the amount of  liquidity puma pay can accumulate  will be a key measure of their success  to encourage people to deposit they've  created a unique reward system as well  as potential for generating earnings  with pumapay  which should be unlike anything  currently available in the defy  space and the details are as follows the  first liquidity pool  pairs pma with bnb and that started on  may 6th of this year on the pancake swap  platform the liquidity goal is 2 million  dollars by july 1st  and the total reward will be 750 million  pma the rewards will be distributed  according to each liquidity provider's  relative share of the pool by the date  of allocation  a reward multiplier will be awarded to  those who deposit early and so i'm  showing the chart here  which breaks down all of the reward  stages now one thing to note  is they will have a special reward set  up for liquidity providers  where early depositors can receive the  reward multipliers  pumapay says that their protocol will be  the most advanced crypto payment  solution on the binance smart chain the  bsc  and in fact pumapay says they'll be the  first ever defy  platform solution to facilitate  recurring crypto billing  on bsc and these liquidity pools are  going to be an integral part of that  system  each transaction is expected to generate  up to two swaps  and this is because merchants and users  will be able to settle and pay in any  currency  with pma being the mediator and sole  means of value transfer over the  protocol and liquidity providers  will earn a fee pumapay has been a  really interesting project to watch over  the past few years  i'm going to continue paying attention  to what's going on with the company and  the technology  i invite you to learn more about what  they have going on especially puma pv  3.0  and the liquidity pools that we've  talked about you can find  all of the information on their website  i've put a link right underneath this  video  and of course this is not a financial  endorsement suggestion or advice for  anybody it's a  discussion of the project everybody  should do  full and extensive due diligence before  making  any decision that will impact your  finances
 

